{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625730/extras/9d6dd1e199051741217436a411ff5e87.avif?t=1573487631\" width=640 height=66 /></span><br>Did you ever want to be an expert at blowing stuff up? Cefore is a physics-based puzzler with a whimsical and simplistic art-style. In Cefore, you play as Baro and are contracted to demolish structures in the most creative ways possible. As the structures get bigger and more complex, your methods of demolition must get more creative.<br>But try not to cause too much destruction!<br><br>In Cefore you control Baro, an intergalactic contractor in charge of gathering the data on different planets. To do so, Baro uses different tools (such as explosive charges, grapples, hot air balloons and several others...) to destroy the environment and gather what he needs. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/625730/extras/5960f23a00961f0f6d0a3ee6c2eccaf7.avif?t=1573487631\" width=640 height=66 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visit different planets</strong></h2>Play through different biomes and enjoy different themes and challenges.<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>100% destructible environment</strong></h2>Everything in the environment is affected by the physics. <br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEVEL EDITOR!</strong></h2>Create, share and play other people's level with the LEVEL EDITOR and Steam Workshop integration!<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes</strong></h2>play the missions or launch the level editor / sandbox modes to get creative as you wish!<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Several tools to destroy and manipulate the environment</strong></h2>Use the tools you want the way you want and get creative destroying the structures<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character customization</strong></h2>Unlock different skins and hats for the character (Baro)<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fly around with your jet-pack</strong></h2><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Over 25 unique and challenging levels</strong></h2></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f5370360e2d1372cbceefbf31f23c36e93b5461d.jpg","localized_name":"Data Decrypted!","name":"Data Decrypted!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/f5370360e2d1372cbceefbf31f23c36e93b5461d.jpg"},{"icon":"f1bcab2e4d95a59a5ec285c49a661e7615996ad8.jpg","localized_name":"YOU DIED","name":"YOU DIED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/f1bcab2e4d95a59a5ec285c49a661e7615996ad8.jpg"},{"icon":"09905828d7f9814499e282a609a34a6447c77671.jpg","localized_name":"Fly as a jet!","name":"Fly as a jet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/09905828d7f9814499e282a609a34a6447c77671.jpg"},{"icon":"0e9a7cefa8cbf48c58a36b7af6eb8ef42ed24d69.jpg","localized_name":"Tools of the trade","name":"Tools of the trade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/0e9a7cefa8cbf48c58a36b7af6eb8ef42ed24d69.jpg"},{"icon":"76f58a349ff95a44a0a2086bfda6858a808b92f5.jpg","localized_name":"Prospector","name":"Prospector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/76f58a349ff95a44a0a2086bfda6858a808b92f5.jpg"},{"icon":"e0b908e4d0263263f1142858f49c62d9877f7db4.jpg","localized_name":"Creator","name":"Creator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/e0b908e4d0263263f1142858f49c62d9877f7db4.jpg"},{"icon":"6ee08d3aa0db8f1b5e5b0c468a38d13b15125024.jpg","localized_name":"QA Tester","name":"QA Tester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/625730/6ee08d3aa0db8f1b5e5